OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on borrowing
OL,4,Acosts at his first Prime Minister's
OL,5,AQuestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch presses Andy Burnham on
OL,8,Fgovernment borrowing costs at his first
OL,9,FPrime Minister's Questions since taking
OL,10,Foffice - watch live at the top of the
OL,11,Fpage
OL,13,FAsked how he plans to tackle rising
OL,14,Fdebt costs, Burnham blames the
OL,15,F"turbulence on global markets" on the
OL,16,Fprevious Tory government - and says "we
OL,17,Fare turning that corner"
OL,19,FToday's PMQs comes as the cost of
OL,20,Fborrowing money for the UK nudges
OL,21,Fhigher, reaching a new 18-year high on
OL,22,FWednesday
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
